<LegalPage
  title="Cookie Notice"
  intro="This website does not use cookies for tracking, analytics, or advertising. Here is exactly what it stores in your browser."
  updated="4 September 2026"
>
  <h2>What cookies are</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files a website stores in your browser. Similar technologies, such as local storage, can store data in the same way. European law requires consent for any cookie or storage that is not strictly necessary to provide the service you asked for.</p>

  <h2>What this website uses</h2>
  <p>getoneward.com is a static website. It does not set cookies and does not use analytics, advertising, or social-media tracking technologies. Because nothing non-essential is stored, no consent banner is shown.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Category</th><th>Used on this site</th><th>Details</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Strictly necessary</td><td>None</td><td>The site does not need cookies or local storage to function. Your form input is not saved in your browser.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Analytics</td><td>None</td><td>We do not measure visits or behaviour on this site.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Marketing</td><td>None</td><td>No advertising or retargeting technologies.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Third-party embeds</td><td>None on this domain</td><td>Links to external services (for example, booking a demo call on Calendly) open on those services' own domains, where their cookie policies apply.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Fonts and assets</h2>
  <p>All fonts, icons, and images are served from this website's own domain. No requests are made to third-party font or asset services when you load a page.</p>

  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If we introduce analytics or other technologies that store data in your browser, we will update this notice first and, where the law requires it, ask for your consent before anything is set.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:privacy@getoneward.com">privacy@getoneward.com</a> <span class="placeholder">[confirm mailbox]</span>. See also our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
